1f:["$","p","34",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Warm (moderately active)"}]," → 1-2 emails/week + one re-engagement campaign at Day 45 of inactivity"]}]
20:["$","p","35",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Cold (inactive >60 days)"}]," → Pause sends. Launch a win-back sequence: *\"We miss you\"* → *\"Here's what's new\"* → *\"Last chance to stay\"* (with one-click preference center link)"]}]
21:["$","h3","37",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"3. **Content Value Density**"}]
22:["$","p","38",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["One highly relevant, personalized email (e.g., \"Your cart is waiting -- here's 15% off\") outperforms five generic \"Here's this week's blog roundup\" messages."]}]
23:["$","p","39",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ *Actionable tip:* Run a quarterly \"value audit.\" For every email you plan, ask:"]}]
24:["$","p","40",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Does this solve a problem *right now*?"]}]
25:["$","p","41",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Would the recipient forward this to a colleague?"]}]
26:["$","p","42",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Is the primary CTA aligned with *their* stage in the customer journey?"]}]
27:["$","p","43",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["If two or more answers are \"no,\" delay or redesign it."]}]
28:["$","hr","45",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
29:["$","h2","47",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"🛠️ 4 Proven Tactics to Optimize Frequency *Without Guesswork*"}]
2a:["$","h3","49",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"✅ 1. **Run a Frequency A/B Test (The Right Way)**"}]
2b:["$","p","50",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Don't test \"2x vs. 4x/week\" blindly. Instead:"]}]
2c:["$","p","51",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Split your list into 3 groups (n ≥ 1,000 each)"]}]
2d:["$","p","52",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Group A: 1 email/week (baseline)"]}]
2e:["$","p","53",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Group B: 2 emails/week (same core content, second email = deep-dive resource or UGC highlight)"]}]
2f:["$","p","54",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Group C: 2 emails/week *plus* dynamic content blocks (e.g., location-based offers, browse-abandonment reminders)"]}]
30:["$","p","55",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["→ Measure *unsubscribes*, *spam complaints*, *click-to-open rate (CTOR)*, and *revenue per email* over 8 weeks."]}]
31:["$","p","57",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["💡 *Real result:* SaaS company *Loom* ran this test in 2023 and discovered their \"2x + dynamic\" group had ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"19% lower unsubscribes"}]," and ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"2.3x higher CTOR"}],", proving *relevance* -- not just frequency -- was the lever."]}]
32:["$","h3","59",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"✅ 2. **Implement Preference Centers (Not Just Unsubscribe Pages)**"}]
33:["$","p","60",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Give subscribers control: let them choose *how often*, *what topics*, and *which formats* (text-only? video preview?) they receive."]}]
34:["$","p","61",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["→ Result: According to Campaign Monitor, brands with preference centers see ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"up to 89% lower unsubscribe rates"}]," and ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"3x higher engagement longevity"}],"."]}]
35:["$","h3","63",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"✅ 3. **Use Engagement-Based Suppression**"}]
36:["$","p","64",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Automatically suppress inactive users from broad campaigns after 30-45 days of zero engagement -- then route them into re-engagement workflows."]}]
37:["$","p","65",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["→ Bonus: This lifts your overall sender reputation, improving inbox placement for *active* users."]}]
38:["$","h3","67",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"✅ 4. **Track the \"Frequency Fatigue Signal\"**"}]
39:["$","p","68",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Watch for these red flags:"]}]
3a:["$","p","69",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Unsubscribe rate spikes >0.5% in a single campaign"]}]
3b:["$","p","70",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- \"Mark as spam\" complaints rise above 0.1%"]}]
3c:["$","p","71",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Open rates drop >15% YoY *without* content or design changes"]}]
3d:["$","p","72",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["When seen, pause, survey (e.g., \"How often would you like to hear from us?\"), and recalibrate."]}]
3e:["$","hr","74",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
3f:["$","h2","76",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"💡 Final Thought: Frequency Is a Promise -- Not a Metric"}]
40:["$","p","78",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Every email you send is a contract: *\"I will respect your time and deliver value.\"* Break it repeatedly, and trust evaporates -- no matter how perfect your segmentation or analytics."]}]
41:["$","p","80",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Start small. Test deliberately. Listen intently. Let your audience -- not your calendar -- define your cadence."]}]
42:["$","p","82",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Because the sweet spot isn't found in spreadsheets."]}]
43:["$","p","83",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["It's discovered in the quiet moment when a subscriber opens your email... and *smiles*."]}]
44:["$","hr","85",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
45:["$","p","87",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Ready to optimize?"}],""]}]
46:["$","p","88",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["👉 *Download our free Frequency Optimization Checklist* (includes segment templates, A/B test planner, and preference center copy snippets) at [yourdomain.com/frequency-checklist](https://yourdomain.com/frequency-checklist)."]}]
47:["$","p","90",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["*Have a frequency win (or horror story)? Share it in the comments below -- let's learn together.* 📩"]}]
